    "scenesThatPass": [
      "EDNA: Yes?\nPATIENCE: Hi, Edna Powers? I'm Patience Price, I called about adopting a cat? I saw your flyer at my vet's office --\nEDNA: Oh yes, do come inside.",
      "SALLY: Look what the cat dragged in.\nPATIENCE: I know, I know, I'm late -- Midnight thought there was a mouse in my pillow.\nSALLY: This is why I only sleep with my own species. Lunch at Joey's?",
      "SALLY: Wow... sorry, Patience, I just found a new best friend.\nPATIENCE: I'm sick of drooling over things I'll never have.\nSALLY: Oh, you're a ray of sunshine. Tell you what, let me take you clubbing this weekend --\nPATIENCE: I'm not sure I'm fit to be seen in public.",
      "PATIENCE: God, people are so rude.\nSALLY: Yes!\nSALLY: She's with me.",
      "PATIENCE: Sally, just -- go in without me --\nSALLY: See, you shoulda bought the dress."
    ]
  },
